      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My lightning talk will mainly cover the subject of network topology maps.&#xA;I&amp;#39;ll explain why the currently available solutions are insufficient in&#xA;some cases and what are the advantages of drawing 3D topology maps. I&amp;#39;ll&#xA;also mention about NMS apps: Graphical UI vs. Web UI and the idea of using&#xA;3D topology maps to create a highly intuitive UI for NMS.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;WiR3D is a SNMP network scanner which uses LANout to visualise the&#xA;scanning results in a 3D scene. In the future more features will be added&#xA;including GTK GUI, monitoring and alerting, so the program will become&#xA;NMS. Here&amp;#39;s the link to the short movie at YouTube showing WiR3D in&#xA;action:&#xA;http://youtube.com/watch?v=SOMvVxcihN8&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
